{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2a5d56a87326801ec69e7838ad1d5b7fc21ea0ff58f913b09d548df8e09a7002","ja":"ロコさん、見てください！\n美術のテスト……100点満点でした！","zh":"ROCO先生，请看！\n美术考试……100分满分了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"229c882b40e9ad4bce3898e6eb77278cc9fd7d7c1b46ea54f11e1f58ddecfffc","ja":"本当ですか！？\nやりましたね、セリカ！！","zh":"真的吗！？\n你做到了，Serika！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"080b5799151af95dac583586d71c14b602263a69798981a30f5131a72c26ecb5","ja":"えへへ。ピカソさんの鑑賞文もすごくよく\n書けてたって、先生に褒められちゃいました。","zh":"嘿嘿。老师夸我说，连关于毕加索先生的鉴赏文也写得特别好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2ec09961b89eae155b47e3266d77be0cd849de24884c9e691d0df0f393a1f472","ja":"ディフィカルトな美術テストの鑑賞文まで……\nパーフェクトなだけじゃなくてワンダフルですね！","zh":"连困难的美术测验的鉴赏文都……不仅完美，而且非常精彩呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3466cea3d0731e21e4c61eb3b891aea5bf1ae6e816807efec5c8bbf74db9e99e","ja":"ロコさんのおかげです！　ありがとうござい\nました。そうだ、何かお礼をさせてください♪","zh":"多亏了ROCO先生！谢谢您。对了，请让我做点什么来答谢您吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ce2f32851ea177314a2b4f8368a60dccdc2952d769123882f2e98060573740a2","ja":"これはプライスレスです！　ロコはセリカに\nアートのことを知ってもらえたのが何よりですから。","zh":"这可是无价之宝！　ROCO能让星梨花了解艺术，才是最重要的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"795c51376a733533792d9380589c60a1f2d902634fa883e52d557329407d28f7","ja":"セリカだけじゃなくって、ウミにもアズサにも……\nみんなとアート勉強会ができてベリーハッピーでした♪","zh":"不只是和星梨花，还有海美、梓……能和大家一起参加艺术学习会，真的超级开心♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"50b0e2e036c8deb3d62689dfe324ef4575828f4c2a01e6bb36965aa69db583cf","ja":"わたしも、ロコさんのお話が聞けて、すっごく\n楽しかったです！　知らない世界を知れました！","zh":"我也听到了ROCO的讲述，超级\n开心！　了解到了未知的世界！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"bbf85407584897c9005c2a2e8483916db90ec71fd6475535f6be03859f2ef3c2","ja":"あの……テストは終わりましたけど\nもしよかったら、また美術のお話してくれませんか？","zh":"那个……考试已经结束了，不过\n如果可以的话，能再和我聊聊美术吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"caee568c699f8bbb652c812b668ec01fec13817dd69239cee50c2fd2c075f5b1","ja":"えっ……いいんですか！？\nアートの話なら、ノンストップで語れますよ！","zh":"咦……真的可以吗！？\n聊艺术的话，我能说个不停！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7c373cdca74a8a5df36c6c3bfbfe512ebc4497fc640f9cd0285992a7ea6664c9","ja":"はい♪　わたし、もっとロコさんに……\nロコ先生に、アートについて教えてもらいたいです♪","zh":"是的♪我还想多向ROCO……  \n向ROCO老师请教艺术方面的知识♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_959.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"eed69397a9d9fd7d7e7adb85eee4a10f6de14fa179e843bcc769acae58ad5c56","ja":"えへへ、わかりました！　どんなアートも、\nロコがいつだってレクチャーしちゃいますね！","zh":"嘿嘿，我知道了！无论什么样的画作，ROCO都会随时给你讲解哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
